cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use packgen in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "packgen: a particle packing generator"
abstract: >-
  packgen generates packings of prismatic particles by simulating their settling
  under gravity, collisions and friction with Blender's rigid-body physics engine,
  and exports the result as an STL mesh.
authors:
